10
00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:48.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逐渐变得脆弱、软弱吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈的流派是真古流</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:55.722 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望能够完成剑术再复兴的大业</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:56.431 --> 00:01:01.853 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
