14
00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:03.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:09.069 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你和在下道不同不相谋</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:14.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术就这样衰弱下去
你难道没有任何感觉吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.078 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为一个剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:21.039 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下衷心希望剑术发扬光大</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:27.128 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在下并不愿看到杀人剑横行的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:30.715 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:31.341 --> 00:01:34.677 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不能赞同吾辈的大志啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:36.930 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:40.016 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从现在起你就是我的敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:54.114 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:33.588 --> 00:03:36.341 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是在前川道场切开地板的那招</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:40.094 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑 缠饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:40.178 --> 00:03:44.182 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈从古流剑术秘籍里复活的剑招</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.102 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害！真不愧是师父！</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:51.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你光跑来跑去是赢不了吾辈的</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:57.654 --> 00:03:59.697 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀刃逆过来的刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:05.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正如这把刀所示 在下已禁绝杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:13.044 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然吾辈视你为敌就一定会打败你</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:04:22.387 --> 00:04:25.098 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之 他们的恩怨
应该暂时告一段落了</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:26.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.732 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝对饶不了你们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:35.316 --> 00:04:39.070 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 知道了
对不住 别那么生气嘛 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:39.153 --> 00:04:40.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别拍我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:43.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们堵住他的嘴还把他绑在树上？</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.410 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是左之助做的</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:49.789 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好！
我肯定用我的必杀把你撕碎…</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:49.872 --> 00:04:52.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真是吵死了
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:55.962 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有大吵大叫的精力</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:56.045 --> 00:04:59.590 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就别做那个大个子的跟屁虫
一个人来道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:59.674 --> 00:05:02.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我就跟你比试比试</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过要用竹刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:16.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我按照约定来了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:20.403 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说…现在才几点？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:22.989 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也没说过什么时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:05:23.072 --> 00:05:25.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 一决胜负吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:05:27.577 --> 00:05:29.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们做个了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:05:29.412 --> 00:05:30.538 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好觉悟吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:32.081 --> 00:05:34.083 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 薰 裁判就拜托你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:39.005 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那么 第一回合…
-你根本没集中精神！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:39.088 --> 00:05:40.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样我还怎么比试啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:43.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别在我耳边这么大声！</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:44.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快醒醒吧 丑八怪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:44.802 --> 00:05:47.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我睡醒了 你个白痴！
-喂 跟我一决胜负吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.765 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听我说话啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:51.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一回合！</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:51.809 --> 00:05:52.935 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 开始吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:53.978 --> 00:05:54.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎？</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:56.856 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:01.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的竹刀握法错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:06:01.903 --> 00:06:05.531 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左右手位置反了</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:08.910 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该左手在下才对…</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:06:08.993 --> 00:06:12.997 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一直用真剑训练！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:06:13.081 --> 00:06:15.458 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以不知道竹刀的握法…</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:18.961 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实真剑和竹刀的握法是一样的</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:21.798 --> 00:06:23.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等等 难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:23.841 --> 00:06:26.552 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你根本没学过剑术？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:29.388 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:29.472 --> 00:06:32.975 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你才来得这么早
就是趁我困的时候和我比试</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:33.059 --> 00:06:34.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:37.522 --> 00:06:40.108 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>雷十太没有指导过你吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么办法？</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:42.652 --> 00:06:46.447 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父现在忙着光大真古流</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:47.281 --> 00:06:52.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真古流对于日本剑术来说至关重要
师父这么说</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:53.162 --> 00:06:56.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能任性地打扰他</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:07:01.504 --> 00:07:02.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没办法啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:04.382 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:07:04.465 --> 00:07:08.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然你都来了
今天就由我来给你上一课吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:07:09.637 --> 00:07:12.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好 首先是竹刀的握法</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:17.437 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左手的小指往这边一点
抓住刀柄的一半</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:07:18.312 --> 00:07:21.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你脸红什么啊？
-烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:23.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 别胡闹</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:26.529 --> 00:07:31.117 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面…</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 就是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:37.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你做得很好 由太郎
-真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:37.165 --> 00:07:39.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的 你很有天分</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我好开心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:41.627 --> 00:07:43.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>休息一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:48.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家一上午什么都没吃
我做了些饭团</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:48.217 --> 00:07:50.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-来 弥彦
-谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:52.388 --> 00:07:53.806 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰那个笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>她到底站在哪边？</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:58.311 --> 00:08:00.396 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-给你 薰小姐
-谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.609 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦正在生闷气呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:08:07.737 --> 00:08:10.198 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是…小孩子脾气</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:08:10.281 --> 00:08:11.824 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:08:11.908 --> 00:08:14.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么事 丑八怪？
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:08:15.745 --> 00:08:17.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:18.206 --> 00:08:19.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:23.211 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是我师父的敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:23.794 --> 00:08:26.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不接受敌人的任何东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.509 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这么死板嘛 给</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:30.092 --> 00:08:34.722 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>战国时的武将上杉谦信
也曾经向他的敌人送盐呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:43.981 --> 00:08:45.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:45.942 --> 00:08:48.819 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 别擅自坐在我旁边啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:49.779 --> 00:08:53.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？竹刀剑术有趣吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:53.282 --> 00:08:55.451 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟只是玩玩</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:55.535 --> 00:08:57.954 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>玩玩的话当然很有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:09:00.957 --> 00:09:03.292 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是只是玩玩没法让我变得更强</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:09:05.169 --> 00:09:11.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要成为师父那样的无敌剑客
给父亲看</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:09:12.009 --> 00:09:16.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-给你父亲看？
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:09:16.806 --> 00:09:19.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他抛下我们武士族的荣誉 做了商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:09:19.892 --> 00:09:22.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一直点头哈腰地向人陪笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:09:22.687 --> 00:09:28.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他还把作为武士之魂的刀剑
卖给外国人</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:29.819 --> 00:09:36.367 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想向这样的父亲展示
凭一把剑就能生活的武士的生存方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:36.951 --> 00:09:40.830 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因出身武士家庭而自豪
这点和弥彦一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:47.461 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但想要变强的理由却完全相反</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:49.088 --> 00:09:53.718 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎 不嫌弃的话
在这里训练一段日子吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:53.801 --> 00:09:54.844 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:55.803 --> 00:09:59.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>暂且放下向谁展示或打败谁的想法</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:03.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先面对你想练习剑术的内心</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:10:04.395 --> 00:10:08.399 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和弥彦互相竞争
一定可以变得更强</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:10:08.482 --> 00:10:12.153 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 这个主意也不错呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:10:12.236 --> 00:10:14.864 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心和薰 你们到底在想什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:10:14.947 --> 00:10:17.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙可是雷十太的弟子啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:10:18.159 --> 00:10:19.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我明白了
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:20.411 --> 00:10:24.165 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是怕我变得比你更厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:24.248 --> 00:10:26.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！荒唐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:27.043 --> 00:10:30.296 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我怎么可能输给你！
-让我说中了</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:31.881 --> 00:10:34.133 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说想在神谷道场训练吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:35.384 --> 00:10:36.802 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拜托您了</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:42.141 --> 00:10:43.309 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:44.727 --> 00:10:46.312 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:46.896 --> 00:10:51.067 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“知己知彼 百战不惧”</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.777 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是《孙子兵法》</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:55.571 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去不断地了解敌人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:55.655 --> 00:10:58.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是 多谢师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:58.866 --> 00:11:01.952 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这还是第一次接受师父的教导</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:03.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他对我期望很高！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:11:14.256 --> 00:11:18.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个小少爷后来就每天都来道场了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:11:18.094 --> 00:11:19.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是满腔热情啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:23.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 他和弥彦相处得也很融洽</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:24.183 --> 00:11:26.769 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说谁是小猴子 你个猫眼混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:26.852 --> 00:11:30.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是对竹刀剑术不感兴趣吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:30.481 --> 00:11:33.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竹刀剑术只是玩玩而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:38.239 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是为了师父和剑心的对决做侦察！</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:38.322 --> 00:11:42.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说是来侦察
但剑心每天都只是在做家务吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.788 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 这一点我也大吃一惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:45.871 --> 00:11:48.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么强大的剑客竟然一直在做家务</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:50.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你就别来这里了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:50.501 --> 00:11:53.379 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我什么时候要听你的命令了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:53.462 --> 00:11:55.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>相处得很融洽 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:56.507 --> 00:11:58.759 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 别吵了</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:59.885 --> 00:12:01.470 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦
-什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:01.554 --> 00:12:06.225 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天由太郎要练习跳击面部
你来做他的目标吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:06.308 --> 00:12:07.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么是我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:11.439 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我对他来说太高了 起不到练习效果</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:11.522 --> 00:12:14.233 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再抱怨了 赶快戴上护具吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:14.316 --> 00:12:16.110 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是代理师父的命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:18.654 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:19.363 --> 00:12:20.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:21.031 --> 00:12:25.453 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我看看
你那摇摇晃晃的剑术 我会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:27.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:28.038 --> 00:12:30.374 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-噢
-怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:31.917 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很震惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:33.002 --> 00:12:37.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他比我想象的更有天分</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.967 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:44.597 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙明明一开始
连竹刀的握法都不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:47.391 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么短的时间内竟然进步了这么多</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:47.475 --> 00:12:49.018 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不再只是嘴上厉害了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:51.729 --> 00:12:52.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:54.815 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:54.899 --> 00:12:58.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你击中真是让我心烦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:58.402 --> 00:13:01.322 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？我接受你的挑衅！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:01.405 --> 00:13:03.532 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:09.246 --> 00:13:10.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（红牛牛锅 酒馆）</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:10.956 --> 00:13:14.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然运动之后饭更好吃啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:18.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 那边的店员
可以给我再来一碗饭吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:18.839 --> 00:13:21.091 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有饭给你吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:21.175 --> 00:13:24.011 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么？我可是客人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:24.094 --> 00:13:26.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不打算阻止他们吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:26.347 --> 00:13:28.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经不想管了</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:28.224 --> 00:13:29.683 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:32.061 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 是小燕</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:35.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是弥彦的朋友吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:35.356 --> 00:13:38.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 算是吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:38.859 --> 00:13:41.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们看起来关系很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们是在吵架！</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:43.989 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里关系好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:44.073 --> 00:13:47.201 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你看不见吗？
-对不起…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:47.284 --> 00:13:50.829 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 别吓到小燕了</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:54.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 请用这个吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:54.875 --> 00:13:56.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎好温柔</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:56.835 --> 00:13:59.213 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟“某个小屁孩”完全不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:01.465 --> 00:14:02.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:05.719 --> 00:14:10.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-由太郎 如果你不嫌弃的话…
-什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:10.641 --> 00:14:13.018 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不要正式成为我们的门生？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:14.311 --> 00:14:15.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么想？</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:15.604 --> 00:14:18.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一直很努力</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:18.148 --> 00:14:22.653 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我相信你和弥彦
一定能成为担负起神谷活心流的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:27.616 --> 00:14:29.910 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 你是个好老师</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:30.578 --> 00:14:34.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这样相信我 我真的很高兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:34.665 --> 00:14:40.045 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有绯村剑心
我知道你其实是个很厉害的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:40.629 --> 00:14:42.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我真的很讨厌那个鸡冠头</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也不喜欢你 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:51.390 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我以前看不起竹刀剑术
但真正尝试起来真的很有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:51.473 --> 00:14:55.352 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很享受在神谷道场的训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:55.936 --> 00:14:57.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 我想果然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:59.064 --> 00:15:02.568 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想变强还是在雷十太师父门下比较好</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:14.788 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我第一次见到师父就是这样的夜晚</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:16.624 --> 00:15:18.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就在这座地藏菩萨面前</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:19.126 --> 00:15:21.211 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们遭到许多强盗的袭击</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:23.505 --> 00:15:24.465 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:24.548 --> 00:15:27.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们想求救就喊吧 塚山先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:28.844 --> 00:15:33.390 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过这种深山老林谁也不会听到</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:33.474 --> 00:15:34.600 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可恶！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:34.683 --> 00:15:37.227 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要多少钱我都可以给你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:37.311 --> 00:15:40.064 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-就饶我们一命吧！
-父亲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:40.147 --> 00:15:42.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可悲啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:42.399 --> 00:15:47.029 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是把士族荣誉
和刀剑一起都换成钱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:47.112 --> 00:15:50.658 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你怎么不跪下来求饶？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:50.741 --> 00:15:52.326 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:52.409 --> 00:15:54.370 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可是东京武士族后裔 塚山由太…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:55.287 --> 00:15:56.080 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:57.122 --> 00:15:59.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>小子 在炫耀吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:59.333 --> 00:16:04.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>像你这样的臭小子
就应该像你父亲一样求饶</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:05.547 --> 00:16:07.174 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对吧 塚山先生？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:07.257 --> 00:16:10.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>求你了 无论如何请饶他一命！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:21.188 --> 00:16:23.190 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只用一击</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:23.273 --> 00:16:25.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一击之下</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:26.193 --> 00:16:30.155 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>强盗们就鸟兽散了</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:30.739 --> 00:16:32.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父他是无敌的</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:34.076 --> 00:16:36.412 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时我就这样想</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:38.539 --> 00:16:41.291 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个雷十太会出手救人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:43.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来不像真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:43.752 --> 00:16:45.170 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 鸡冠头</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:45.796 --> 00:16:49.633 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父沉默寡言又面无表情
所以大家都误会他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:50.843 --> 00:16:55.973 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拥有驱散世间一切的力量
就是我的理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:58.392 --> 00:17:04.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我像师父一样强大
长大后就不用像父亲那样软弱地活着</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:06.483 --> 00:17:07.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:08.652 --> 00:17:10.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你总有一天
还是要跟师父战斗 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:11.488 --> 00:17:15.451 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那时请一定堂堂正正分出胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:18.829 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:18.912 --> 00:17:21.331 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这才是真正的男人之间的对决…</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:26.253 --> 00:17:27.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父！</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:30.883 --> 00:17:32.051 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父？</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:32.634 --> 00:17:35.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>夜里突然从背后偷袭</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:35.345 --> 00:17:38.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他终于露出了本来面目</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:38.557 --> 00:17:41.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不！刚才那只是在打招呼</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:41.602 --> 00:17:43.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父他不是认真的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:44.229 --> 00:17:45.814 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说的对吧 师父？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:47.649 --> 00:17:48.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:53.238 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>退后吧 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:03.957 --> 00:18:06.752 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我的斩马刀好像</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:07.336 --> 00:18:10.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管有多大的威力 打不中就没意义</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:12.591 --> 00:18:14.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-扔沙子！
-好卑鄙！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:14.301 --> 00:18:15.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父！</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:16.678 --> 00:18:17.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太天真了</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:18.972 --> 00:18:21.016 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>龙槌闪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:31.318 --> 00:18:36.198 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我的缠饭纲没法打败你</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:39.201 --> 00:18:42.704 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不得不使出这终极招数了</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:44.832 --> 00:18:47.042 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘剑 飞饭纲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:49.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:56.802 --> 00:18:57.845 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:59.638 --> 00:19:01.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>得赶紧止血去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:01.515 --> 00:19:04.434 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打到的不是要害 他死不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:07.980 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:08.063 --> 00:19:10.732 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的招式把自己的弟子打伤了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:10.816 --> 00:19:12.442 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:13.152 --> 00:19:17.531 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真以为吾辈真把那孩子当弟子？</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:19:17.614 --> 00:19:19.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:24.705 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如今的时代靠剑术赚不到钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:19:25.289 --> 00:19:29.835 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但光大新古流需要大量的资金</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:19:30.502 --> 00:19:33.130 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那小子是赞助人的儿子</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:19:33.714 --> 00:19:37.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才忍着厌烦扮演他的师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:42.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了赞助 我还演了一出
强盗抢劫的戏 可惜现在全没了</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:43.348 --> 00:19:46.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了 总能再找到另一个人来赞助</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:47.477 --> 00:19:49.062 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:49.897 --> 00:19:53.108 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我要先消灭你</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:53.734 --> 00:19:56.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-来啊
-在那等一刻钟</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:57.905 --> 00:19:59.990 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下要带由太郎去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:20:01.408 --> 00:20:03.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看完之后再来收拾你</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:11.627 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他终于认真起来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:20:12.377 --> 00:20:17.466 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个鸟人大叔
还没意识到自己干了什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:24.306 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你可是触碰了
这世上最恐怖男人的逆鳞</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:27.476 --> 00:20:29.353 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（小国诊所）</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:31.688 --> 00:20:33.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:33.649 --> 00:20:35.192 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎怎么样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:35.275 --> 00:20:37.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底是什么伤了他？</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤口那么宽 失血量却很少</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:41.365 --> 00:20:44.952 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种情况我还是第一次见</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:45.035 --> 00:20:47.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:48.038 --> 00:20:49.581 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个 由太郎…</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:49.665 --> 00:20:51.750 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有生命危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:53.377 --> 00:20:54.378 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:55.587 --> 00:20:56.505 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过？</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:56.588 --> 00:21:00.467 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的肌肉和神经都被切断了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:02.552 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很抱歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:21:03.136 --> 00:21:06.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这可怜的孩子再也不能练习剑术了</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:22:46.281 --> 00:22:48.408 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《了结》</c.simplifiedchinese>

